Package: MotivatoR
Title: MotivatoR is a simple and light R package designed to provide random motivational messages.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Luz Garcia-Longoria", "Carlos Mora Rubio", , "luzlongoria@unex.es", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: MotivatoR is a simple and light R package designed to provide random motivational messages. It's a fun and encouraging way to keep your spirits high while coding, analyzing data, or navigating through scientific work.
This project was inspired by an idea from Carlos Mora Rubio, to whom I dedicate this package with appreciation.
Installation : install.packages("devtools")  ### in case you need it
devtools::install_github("luzlongoria/MotivatoR") ## for dowloading to your R sesion
library(MotivatoR)
motivation() #### for getting motivational messages whenever you want :)
